---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Encuentra Personas con Tu Contexto
description: Descubre qué personas ficticias comparten tu perfil demográfico
---

<div class="quiz-container">
  <div class="quiz-header">
    <h1>👥 Encuentra Personas con Tu Contexto</h1>
    <p class="quiz-intro">
      Responde <strong>6 preguntas</strong> sobre tu perfil demográfico y situación personal.
      Te mostraremos qué <strong>personas electorales ficticias</strong> (perfiles creados para este estudio)
      comparten contexto similar al tuyo y cómo evaluaron los programas presidenciales.
    </p>
    <p class="quiz-disclaimer-top">
      ℹ️ Este es un ejercicio informativo con fines educativos. Las personas son ficticias y esto NO constituye recomendación electoral.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div id="quiz-content">
    <!-- Question 1: Age -->
    <div class="quiz-question active" data-question="1">
      <h2>1. ¿En qué rango de edad estás?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="18-25">18-25 años</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="26-35">26-35 años</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="36-50">36-50 años</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="51+">51+ años</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 2: Work Situation -->
    <div class="quiz-question" data-question="2">
      <h2>2. ¿Cuál es tu situación laboral?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="dependiente">Trabajador dependiente</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="independiente">Trabajador independiente / Emprendedor</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="profesional">Profesional (universidad)</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="estudiante">Estudiante</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="jubilado">Jubilado/a</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="duena-casa">Dueña de casa</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 3: Income Level -->
    <div class="quiz-question" data-question="3">
      <h2>3. ¿En qué rango está tu ingreso familiar mensual?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="bajo">Menos de $500.000</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="medio-bajo">$500.000 - $1.000.000</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="medio">$1.000.000 - $2.000.000</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="medio-alto">$2.000.000 - $3.500.000</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="alto">Más de $3.500.000</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 4: Location -->
    <div class="quiz-question" data-question="4">
      <h2>4. ¿Dónde vives?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="santiago-oriente">Santiago (sector oriente)</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="santiago-sur">Santiago (sector sur)</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="santiago-otro">Santiago (otras comunas)</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="region-urbano">Región (ciudad)</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="region-rural">Región (zona rural)</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 5: Family Situation -->
    <div class="quiz-question" data-question="5">
      <h2>5. ¿Cuál es tu situación familiar?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="solo">Vivo solo/a</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="pareja">En pareja sin hijos</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="familia-joven">Familia con hijos pequeños</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="familia-escolar">Familia con hijos en edad escolar</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="familia-adulta">Hijos adultos / Adulto mayor</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Question 6: Education Level -->
    <div class="quiz-question" data-question="6">
      <h2>6. ¿Cuál es tu nivel educacional?</h2>
      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="basica-media">Básica / Media</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="tecnica">Técnica / CFT</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="universitaria-incompleta">Universitaria incompleta</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="universitaria">Universitaria completa</button>
        <button class="quiz-option" data-value="postgrado">Postgrado / Magíster / Doctorado</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Results Section -->
    <div id="quiz-results" class="quiz-results" style="display: none;">
      <h2>✨ Tus Resultados</h2>

      <div class="results-section">
        <h3>Personas con perfil similar al tuyo:</h3>
        <div id="matched-personas" class="matched-personas"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="results-actions">
        <a href="{{ '/matriz/' | url }}" class="btn btn-primary">Ver matriz completa</a>
        <button id="restart-quiz" class="btn btn-secondary">Repetir quiz</button>
      </div>

      <p class="results-disclaimer">
        ⚠️ <strong>Este es un ejercicio informativo con fines educativos.</strong>
        Los resultados muestran coincidencias demográficas entre tu perfil y personas ficticias creadas para este estudio.
        Este contenido NO constituye recomendación electoral ni debe ser la única fuente para decisiones de voto.
        Te invitamos a leer los programas completos y consultar múltiples fuentes antes de votar.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="quiz-progress">
    <div class="progress-bar">
      <div id="progress-fill" class="progress-fill" style="width: 0%"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="progress-text">Pregunta <span id="current-question">0</span> de 6</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // Inject personas data from Eleventy
  const personasData = {{ personas | dump | safe }};
  const matrizData = {{ matriz | dump | safe }};

  // Quiz State
  let answers = {
    age: null,
    work: null,
    income: null,
    location: null,
    family: null,
    education: null
  };

  let currentQuestion = 0;
  const totalQuestions = 6;

  // Expanded personas database with demographic profiles
  const personasDB = {
    '01-maria-jose-contreras': { age: '26-35', work: 'profesional', income: 'medio-alto', location: 'santiago-oriente', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'universitaria' },
    '02-juan-carlos-munoz': { age: '51+', work: 'jubilado', income: 'bajo', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '03-luis-hernandez': { age: '36-50', work: 'independiente', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'basica-media' },
    '04-catalina-rojas': { age: '18-25', work: 'estudiante', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'solo', education: 'universitaria-incompleta' },
    '05-rosa-perez': { age: '51+', work: 'independiente', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'region-urbano', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'basica-media' },
    '06-pedro-quintana': { age: '36-50', work: 'dependiente', income: 'medio', location: 'region-urbano', family: 'familia-escolar', education: 'tecnica' },
    '07-daniela-soto': { age: '26-35', work: 'profesional', income: 'medio', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'universitaria' },
    '08-jose-miguel-valdes': { age: '51+', work: 'independiente', income: 'medio', location: 'region-rural', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '09-alejandra-martinez': { age: '26-35', work: 'profesional', income: 'medio-alto', location: 'santiago-oriente', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'universitaria' },
    '10-carmen-huaiquilaf': { age: '36-50', work: 'duena-casa', income: 'bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-escolar', education: 'basica-media' },
    '11-carla-espinoza': { age: '36-50', work: 'dependiente', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'solo', education: 'tecnica' },
    '12-roberto-gonzalez': { age: '36-50', work: 'profesional', income: 'alto', location: 'santiago-oriente', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'universitaria' },
    '13-carlos-barria': { age: '51+', work: 'independiente', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'region-rural', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '14-yohana-rodriguez': { age: '26-35', work: 'dependiente', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-joven', education: 'tecnica' },
    '15-miguel-angel-castro': { age: '51+', work: 'dependiente', income: 'bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '16-francisco-valdes': { age: '36-50', work: 'independiente', income: 'medio-alto', location: 'santiago-oriente', family: 'familia-escolar', education: 'universitaria' },
    '17-javiera-mella': { age: '26-35', work: 'independiente', income: 'bajo', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'solo', education: 'universitaria' },
    '18-patricia-morales': { age: '36-50', work: 'dependiente', income: 'medio', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-escolar', education: 'tecnica' },
    '19-matias-contreras': { age: '18-25', work: 'estudiante', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'solo', education: 'universitaria-incompleta' },
    '20-hector-silva': { age: '36-50', work: 'dependiente', income: 'bajo', location: 'region-rural', family: 'familia-escolar', education: 'basica-media' },
    '21-andrea-fuentes': { age: '36-50', work: 'duena-casa', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '22-diego-ramirez': { age: '18-25', work: 'estudiante', income: 'medio', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'solo', education: 'universitaria-incompleta' },
    '23-gonzalo-larrain': { age: '36-50', work: 'profesional', income: 'alto', location: 'santiago-oriente', family: 'pareja', education: 'postgrado' },
    '24-bryan-flores': { age: '18-25', work: 'estudiante', income: 'bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '25-dr-sebastian-herrera': { age: '26-35', work: 'profesional', income: 'medio-alto', location: 'santiago-oriente', family: 'pareja', education: 'postgrado' },
    '26-isabel-parra': { age: '51+', work: 'profesional', income: 'medio', location: 'region-urbano', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'universitaria' },
    '27-manuel-gutierrez': { age: '36-50', work: 'dependiente', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-sur', family: 'familia-adulta', education: 'basica-media' },
    '28-camila-oyarzun': { age: '26-35', work: 'profesional', income: 'medio-bajo', location: 'santiago-otro', family: 'solo', education: 'universitaria' }
  };

  // Event listeners for quiz options
  document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(button => {
    button.addEventListener('click', function() {
      const questionDiv = this.closest('.quiz-question');
      const questionNum = questionDiv.dataset.question;
      const value = this.dataset.value;

      // Store answer
      const questionKeys = ['age', 'work', 'income', 'location', 'family', 'education'];
      answers[questionKeys[questionNum - 1]] = value;

      // Visual feedback
      questionDiv.querySelectorAll('.quiz-option').forEach(opt => opt.classList.remove('selected'));
      this.classList.add('selected');

      // Move to next question
      setTimeout(() => {
        if (questionNum < totalQuestions) {
          showQuestion(parseInt(questionNum) + 1);
        } else {
          showResults();
        }
      }, 300);
    });
  });

  function showQuestion(num) {
    currentQuestion = num;

    // Hide all questions
    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => q.classList.remove('active'));

    // Show current question
    const currentQ = document.querySelector(`[data-question="${num}"]`);
    if (currentQ) {
      currentQ.classList.add('active');
      currentQ.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
    }

    // Update progress
    const progress = (num / totalQuestions) * 100;
    document.getElementById('progress-fill').style.width = progress + '%';
    document.getElementById('current-question').textContent = num;
  }

  function showResults() {
    // Hide questions
    document.querySelectorAll('.quiz-question').forEach(q => q.style.display = 'none');

    // Show results
    document.getElementById('quiz-results').style.display = 'block';
    document.getElementById('quiz-results').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });

    // Calculate matches
    const matchedPersonas = calculatePersonaMatches();

    // Display matched personas
    displayMatchedPersonas(matchedPersonas);

    // Update progress to 100%
    document.getElementById('progress-fill').style.width = '100%';
    document.getElementById('current-question').textContent = '6';
  }

  function calculatePersonaMatches() {
    // Score each persona based on demographic answer matches
    const scores = [];

    for (const [slug, persona] of Object.entries(personasDB)) {
      let score = 0;
      const matches = [];

      // Age - important demographic
      if (answers.age === persona.age) {
        score += 8;
        matches.push({ type: 'age', label: 'Rango de edad', weight: 8 });
      }

      // Income level - very important for life situation
      if (answers.income === persona.income) {
        score += 9;
        matches.push({ type: 'income', label: 'Nivel de ingreso', weight: 9 });
      }

      // Work situation - defines daily reality
      if (answers.work === persona.work) {
        score += 10;
        matches.push({ type: 'work', label: 'Situación laboral', weight: 10 });
      }

      // Family situation - affects priorities and needs
      if (answers.family === persona.family) {
        score += 7;
        matches.push({ type: 'family', label: 'Situación familiar', weight: 7 });
      }

      // Location - regional/urban differences
      if (answers.location === persona.location) {
        score += 5;
        matches.push({ type: 'location', label: 'Ubicación', weight: 5 });
      }

      // Education level
      if (answers.education === persona.education) {
        score += 6;
        matches.push({ type: 'education', label: 'Nivel educacional', weight: 6 });
      }

      // Only include personas with some match
      if (score > 0) {
        scores.push({ slug, score, matches });
      }
    }

    // Sort by score descending
    scores.sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score);

    // Return top 5 matches with their match details
    return scores.slice(0, 5);
  }

  function getRatingClass(rating) {
    if (rating >= 7.0) return 'high';
    if (rating >= 5.0) return 'medium';
    if (rating >= 3.0) return 'low';
    return 'poor';
  }

  function displayMatchedPersonas(personaMatches) {
    const container = document.getElementById('matched-personas');

    if (personaMatches.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML = '<p>No se encontraron coincidencias exactas. Te recomendamos explorar todas las personas en el sitio.</p>';
      return;
    }

    const personaNames = {
      '01-maria-jose-contreras': 'María José Contreras - La Profesional Agobiada',
      '02-juan-carlos-munoz': 'Juan Carlos Muñoz - El Jubilado Precarizado',
      '03-luis-hernandez': 'Luis Hernández - El Emprendedor de Subsistencia',
      '04-catalina-rojas': 'Catalina Rojas - La Universitaria Endeudada',
      '05-rosa-perez': 'Rosa Pérez - La Microempresaria Ahogada',
      '06-pedro-quintana': 'Pedro Quintana - El Obrero del Norte',
      '07-daniela-soto': 'Daniela Soto - La Funcionaria Pública Quemada',
      '08-jose-miguel-valdes': 'José Miguel Valdés - El Agricultor Amenazado',
      '09-alejandra-martinez': 'Alejandra Martínez - La Teletrabajadora Atrapada',
      '10-carmen-huaiquilaf': 'Carmen Huaiquilaf - La Madre Mapuche Urbana',
      '11-carla-espinoza': 'Carla Espinoza - La Vendedora Retail Precaria',
      '12-roberto-gonzalez': 'Roberto González - El Santiaguino Hastiado',
      '13-carlos-barria': 'Carlos Barría - El Pescador Artesanal Olvidado',
      '14-yohana-rodriguez': 'Yohana Rodríguez - La Migrante Integrada',
      '15-miguel-angel-castro': 'Miguel Ángel Castro - El Poblador Histórico',
      '16-francisco-valdes': 'Francisco Valdés - El Empresario PYME Sofisticado',
      '17-javiera-mella': 'Javiera Mella - La Artista Precarizada',
      '18-patricia-morales': 'Patricia Morales - La Deudora Habitacional',
      '19-matias-contreras': 'Matías Contreras - El Joven LGBTQ+',
      '20-hector-silva': 'Héctor Silva - El Temporal Agrícola',
      '21-andrea-fuentes': 'Andrea Fuentes - La Cuidadora Invisible',
      '22-diego-ramirez': 'Diego Ramírez - El Gamer Semi-Pro',
      '23-gonzalo-larrain': 'Gonzalo Larraín - El Gerente Desencantado',
      '24-bryan-flores': 'Bryan Flores - El Nini Atrapado',
      '25-dr-sebastian-herrera': 'Dr. Sebastián Herrera - El Médico Agotado',
      '26-isabel-parra': 'Isabel Parra - La Profe Militante',
      '27-manuel-gutierrez': 'Manuel Gutiérrez - El Chofer de Micro',
      '28-camila-oyarzun': 'Camila Oyarzún - La Activista Climática'
    };

    container.innerHTML = personaMatches.map(({ slug, score, matches }) => {
      // Find persona data (slug is stored as 'id' in personas data)
      const personaData = personasData.find(p => p.id === slug);
      if (!personaData) return '';

      // Get top 3 voting intentions
      const topVotes = personaData.voteIntention.slice(0, 3);

      return `
      <div class="persona-card-detailed">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <h4>${personaNames[slug] || slug}</h4>
          <span class="match-score">${score} pts</span>
        </div>

        <div class="match-criteria">
          <p class="match-label">Coincidencias demográficas:</p>
          <div class="match-badges">
            ${matches.map(match => `
              <span class="match-badge match-badge-${match.type}" title="${match.label}">
                ✓ ${match.label}
              </span>
            `).join('')}
          </div>
        </div>

        ${personaData.fraseTipica ? `
        <div class="persona-phrase-quiz">
          <em>"${personaData.fraseTipica}"</em>
        </div>
        ` : ''}

        <div class="persona-demographics-quiz">
          ${personaData.edad ? `<span class="demo-item">🎂 ${personaData.edad}</span>` : ''}
          ${personaData.ingreso ? `<span class="demo-item">💰 ${personaData.ingreso}</span>` : ''}
          ${personaData.ocupacion ? `<span class="demo-item">💼 ${personaData.ocupacion}</span>` : ''}
          ${personaData.ubicacion ? `<span class="demo-item">📍 ${personaData.ubicacion}</span>` : ''}
          ${personaData.situacion ? `<span class="demo-item">👥 ${personaData.situacion}</span>` : ''}
        </div>

        ${personaData.contexto && personaData.contexto.length > 0 ? `
        <div class="persona-context-quiz">
          <h5>📋 Contexto:</h5>
          <ul class="context-list-compact">
            ${personaData.contexto.map(item => `<li>${item}</li>`).join('')}
          </ul>
        </div>
        ` : ''}

        ${topVotes.length > 0 ? `
        <div class="vote-intention-compact">
          <div class="vote-boxes-compact">
            ${topVotes.map((vote, idx) => `
              <div class="vote-box-compact">
                <div class="vote-box-rank">#${idx + 1}</div>
                <div class="vote-box-candidate">${vote.candidato}</div>
                <div class="vote-box-rating rating-${getRatingClass(vote.rating)}">${vote.rating.toFixed(1)}</div>
              </div>
            `).join('')}
          </div>
        </div>
        ` : `
        <div class="vote-intention-pending">
          <p class="pending-message">⏳ Evaluaciones en proceso</p>
        </div>
        `}

        <a href="{{ '/personas/' | url }}${slug}/" class="btn-link-detailed">Ver perfil completo →</a>
      </div>
      `;
    }).join('');
  }

  // Restart quiz
  document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    if (e.target && e.target.id === 'restart-quiz') {
      location.reload();
    }
  });

  // Initialize quiz
  showQuestion(1);
</script>

<style>
.quiz-container {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.quiz-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
}

.quiz-header h1 {
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
}

.quiz-intro {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.quiz-disclaimer-top {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: var(--spacing-md) auto 0;
  padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
  background: #FFF9E6;
  border-left: 4px solid #FF9800;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.quiz-question {
  display: none;
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
}

.quiz-question.active {
  display: block;
  opacity: 1;
}

.quiz-question h2 {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  color: var(--color-text);
}

.quiz-options {
  display: grid;
  gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
}

.quiz-option {
  padding: var(--spacing-md);
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-size: 1rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  text-align: left;
}

.quiz-option:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  background: #E3F2FD;
}

.quiz-option.selected {
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: white;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.quiz-progress {
  margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
  padding-top: var(--spacing-lg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}

.progress-bar {
  width: 100%;
  height: 8px;
  background: var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
}

.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--color-primary);
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

.progress-text {
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.quiz-results {
  padding: var(--spacing-xl);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E3F2FD 0%, #FFF9C4 100%);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
}

.quiz-results h2 {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
}

.results-section {
  margin: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
}

.results-section h3 {
  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  color: var(--color-text);
